{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790445977191,"sessionID":"ses_f211b9116ffe0JYDexDvFtXnzO","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"read_6_0fab35c0","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/task_config.json"},"output":"<path>/workspace/task_config.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"instruction\": \"Implement scenes/draggable.tscn as a decoration component that can be dragged. The root Area2D must be named Draggable in the scene, set collision_mask to 2, linear_damp to 20, and attach scripts/draggable.gd. Under it, add Sprite2D named Sprite that uses assets/sprites/star_1.png and is uniformly scaled to 0.58, plus a CollisionShape2D named CollisionShape that holds a 72\\u00d772 RectangleShape2D covering the sprite. Implement scripts/draggable.gd so it records initial_position and initial_scale on _ready(), shrinks to zero and tweens back in play_spawn_animation(), listens for the \\\"click\\\" action in _on_input_event/_input, lerps toward the mouse while dragging, emits dropped(self, overlapping_areas) on release, and calls self_destruct() with a shrink tween whenever it is dropped outside DropTarget's region.\"\n3: }\n\n(End of file - total 3 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement scenes/draggable.tscn as a decoration component that can be dragged. The root Area2D must be named Draggable in the scene, set collision_mask to 2, linear_damp to 20, and attach scripts/draggable.gd. Under it, add Sprite2D named Sprite that uses assets/sprites/star_1.png and is uniformly scaled to 0.58, plus a CollisionShape2D named CollisionShape that holds a 72\\u00d772 RectangleShape2D covering the sprite. Implement scripts/draggable.gd so it records initial_position and initial_scale on _ready(), shrinks to zero and tweens back in play_spawn_animation(), listens for the \\\"click\\\" action in _on_input_event/_input, lerps toward the mouse while dragging, emits dropped(self, overlapping_areas) on releas